9.9 122.3 152.4 118.3 154.4 C114.4 156.4 109.9 158.1 105.5 159.0 C101.0 160.0 93.9 160.0 91.6 160.1\"/>\n<path class=\"ink\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M40 120 L63.0 120\"/><polygon class=\"ink-fill\" points=\"74.0,120.0 63.0,124.0 63.0,116.0\"/>\n<path class=\"ink\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M123.6 109.0 Q200.0 30.0 268.8 101.1\"/><polygon class=\"ink-fill\" points=\"276.4,109.0 265.9,103.9 271.7,98.3\"/>\n<path class=\"ink\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M276.4 131.0 Q200.0 150.0 134.2 133.6\"/><polygon class=\"ink-fill\" points=\"123.6,131.0 135.2,129.8 133.3,137.5\"/>\n<path class=\"ink\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M89.0 96.4 C76.6 52.4 123.4 52.4 114.0 85.8\"/><polygon class=\"ink-fill\" points=\"111.0,96.4 110.1,84.8 117.8,86.9\"/>\n<path class=\"ink\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M289.0 96.4 C276.6 52.4 323.4 52.4 314.0 85.8\"/><polygon class=\"ink-fill\" points=\"311.0,96.4 310.1,84.8 317.8,86.9\"/>\n<g id=\"state-1\"><circle class=\"ink\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"120\" r=\"26\" pathLength=\"1\"/><circle class=\"ink\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"120\" r=\"21\" pathLength=\"1\"/><text class=\"tex-i\" x=\"100\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\">q<tspan dy=\".3em\" font-size=\".7em\">0</tspan></text></g>\n<g id=\"state-2\"><circle class=\"ink\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"120\" r=\"26\" pathLength=\"1\"/><text class=\"tex-i\" x=\"300\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\">q<tspan dy=\".3em\" font-size=\".7em\">1</tspan></text></g>\n<text class=\"tex\" x=\"200\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a</text>\n<text class=\"tex\" x=\"200\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a</text>\n<text class=\"tex\" x=\"100\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\">b</text>\n<text class=\"tex\" x=\"300\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\">b</text>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"tape-row\"><span class=\"frame-word\">input</span><ol class=\"tape\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Input tape\"><li data-highlight=\"2\">a</li><li data-highlight=\"3\">b</li><li data-highlight=\"4\">a</li></ol></div></figure>\n<div class=\"work\">\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"1\"><div class=\"n\">1</div><p>Start in \\(q_0\\): no a's read yet, and zero is even.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"2\"><div class=\"n\">2</div><p>Read a: \\(q_0 \\to q_1\\), one a, odd.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"3\"><div class=\"n\">3</div><p>Read b: \\(q_1 \\to q_1\\); a b does not change the count.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"4\"><div class=\"n\">4</div><p>Read a: \\(q_1 \\to q_0\\), two a's, even.</p></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"5\"><div class=\"n\">5</div><p>The input is finished in \\(q_0\\), an accepting state: aba is accepted.</p></div>\n</div></div>"
